<!doctype html>
<html>
  <body style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, sans-serif; max-width: 480px; margin: 40px auto; color: #1a1a1a; line-height: 1.5;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px;">Your password was changed</h1>
    <p>Hi {{name}},</p>
    <p>This is a confirmation that your Trace password was just changed. If this was you, no action is needed.</p>
    <p><strong>If you didn't change your password</strong>, your account may be at risk. Contact us immediately at <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}">{{supportEmail}}</a> or call {{supportMobileNumber}}.</p>
    <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin: 32px 0;" />
    <p style="color: #bbb; font-size: 12px;">&copy; {{currentYear}} Trace</p>
  </body>
</html>
